# Vault lock ruling 35 headed check. The launcher starts Turnstone with the
# persisted lock's marker in the vault directory (XDG_DATA_HOME on Linux and
# macOS, LOCALAPPDATA on Windows, then personae/vault/locked) and removes it a
# few seconds in, standing in for djinn's unlock prompt. Turnstone starts with
# its identity pending and still browses; once the marker clears, its watch
# opens the root and the app adopts it. No fallback key is minted while
# locked.
settle 30
key escape
assert event profile-identity-pending
open mere://alpha
settle 20
assert snap node-count >= 1
settle 900
assert event profile-identity-unlocked
log vault locked pending receipt complete
